# Operation AkaiRyu Campaign Research

## Overview
This repository contains detailed cybersecurity threat intelligence and campaign research on **Operation AkaiRyu (RedDragon)**, a sophisticated cyber espionage campaign attributed to **MirrorFace (Earth Kasha)**, a subgroup of **APT10 (menuPass)**.

The research focuses on:
- Threat actor profiling
- Campaign timeline
- Attack flow analysis
- MITRE ATT&CK mapping
- Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)
- Detection opportunities
- Defensive recommendations
- Real-world incidents

